This engineering package defines the complete physical hardware architecture for
the near-term ENERGIZE platform, translating theoretical quantum state scanning,
astrophysical QKD ingestion, and precision reconstruction loops into a fully
realizable 2026 industrial hardware system. All components listed are available
using commercial-grade cryogenics, optical benches, FPGA accelerators, and
high-gain astrophysical telemetry receivers.
\end{abstract}

