\section{Physical Hardware Architecture}
% ============================================================

The ENERGIZE hardware platform integrates:

\begin{itemize}
    \item High-frequency femtosecond laser arrays ($438\ \mathrm{THz}$),
    \item Sub-Kelvin SNSPD optical detection benches,
    \item PCIe 5.0 FPGA tensor acceleration boards,
    \item Mu-metal shielded ultra-high vacuum chambers,
    \item Astrophysical QKD ingestion modems.
\end{itemize}

This architecture supports atomic digitization, secure astrophysical key
generation, and precision reconstruction.

